sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Customer
    participant CA as CustomerApp (Render)
    participant KC as Keycloak (Fly)
    participant API as API (Fly)
    participant PG as Postgres (Aiven)
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ (CloudAMQP)
    participant S as Stripe

    U->>CA: open /app
    CA->>KC: /auth (code + PKCE)
    KC-->>CA: id_token + access_token
    CA->>API: GET /bouquets?lat,lng  (Bearer)
    API->>PG: nearby available bouquets
    PG-->>API: rows
    API-->>CA: JSON
    CA-->>U: map + list

    U->>CA: add-to-cart, checkout
    CA->>API: POST /cart/items
    CA->>API: POST /orders/preview
    CA->>API: POST /orders
    API->>PG: reserve bouquets (OrderReservationExpiryService)
    API->>RMQ: OrderCreated
    API->>S: PaymentIntent.create
    S-->>API: client_secret
    API-->>CA: order + client_secret
    CA-->>U: Stripe Elements

    U->>S: 3DS + pay
    S->>API: POST /api/stripe/webhook (signed)
    API->>PG: confirm order, mark Sold
    API->>RMQ: BouquetSold
